      "act": "THE IDEA",
      "lane": "IDEA",
      "narration_text": "Here's the idea of this film. When your skill fires and when it stays quiet is decided by one line — the description in its frontmatter. The temptation is to craft that line: write it carefully, make it pushy, use every word the user might say. What the Skill Creator actually does is measure it. Same ask, two descriptions, both runs, count the fires. You cannot guess this. You test.",
